Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a winter fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.\NShine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, just that\Nyou can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Show that tramp the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been about a week, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you're here to call it quits, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been Corazon's personal\Nbungee bag since you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked a runt like\Nyou stuck it out so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,When things get tough, we\Nusually see the weaklings bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta have some big stones\Nif you want to run with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a blood law around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If executives aren't shown proper respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The family falls apart. This\None time, I cracked up at Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pika's voice and then\Nnearly tortured me to death
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to scare\Nme off, it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already experienced true hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You play a good hand, kid,\Nbut I see through your bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, Corazon is\Nmy dear brother by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I find out anyone\Nlays a scratch on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say it's curtains for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep away from us, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's whitebeard disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop Jola you should know\Nbetter than to spout nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,as facts shame on you look\Nat that you wound Buffalo up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's caused by a toxin that\Ncan't spread person to person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how you get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not catching your gross-ass cuties!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you the last one left, or are\Nthere any other survivors of White Town?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell if I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was busy escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And how did you manage to get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I hid an amount of dead bodies,\Nthen snuck over the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you have an axe to grind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,These days I don't believe in anything\Nand I'm not even afraid to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.34,0:04:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't go pressing your\Nluck with me, Corazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to lose and before my\Ntime comes, I plan on taking you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:04:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:04:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.98,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not above torturing\Nkids here, so don't try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You should never mess\Nwith pirates. Crying won't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,save you because we're\Nliving in a grown-up's world,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, so what's the deal with\Nthat white town thing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's another name for\Nthe kingdom of Flevins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a wealthy place and everything\Nfrom their soil to their foliage was
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,pure white Visiting was like stepping\Ninto a snow-filled fairytale kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It was often described as\Nhaving an unusual beauty to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, they unearthed a type\Nof metal called white lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just beneath their kingdom's surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,it was discovered that this was the\Nsource of their breathtaking landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They harvested this metal and\Nused it to make tableware,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,paints, sweeteners,\Ncosmetics, and even weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,These unique products drew attention from
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,all over the world and\Nbecame high in demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This, in turn, made\NFlevince's economy boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the world government took notice and\Nprofited by helping to export their goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,White lead was a cash grab\Nfor all those involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Law, for this kind of surgery, you\Nshould focus on these blood vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, brother, you want\Nto go to the festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you two took him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fight that. Sound like fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just 30 minutes, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.06,0:06:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a fair number\Nof patients to see today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Law, please say you'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At one point in time, Whitetown was\Nthe fascination of the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.56,0:06:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, it's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With a capital G.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A century ago, when the white\Nlead industry first began,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the world government surveyed\Nthe land scrutinously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, Flevance held a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,White lead's toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If left intact underground, it\Nposed little harm, but once handled,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it slowly poisoned its victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.59,0:07:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,both the government and the royalty\Nwere so blinded by the incredible wealth
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,they were accumulating that they brushed\Nthe dangerous truth under the rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The citizens continued to excavate the\Nwhite lead without knowing the risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means all those\Npoor people must have died?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Appallingly, the suffering of\NFlevitz's population doesn't end there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say a young man has even a\Ntrace amount of lead in his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If he eventually has offspring,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that child's life expectancy would\Nalready be shortened at birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And when that child grew into an\Nadult and had children of their own,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,their lifespan would\Nbe even shorter still.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The life expectancy kept reducing until\Neventually it reached law's generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They died before making it to\Nadulthood unfortunately by the time the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,world caught on that white lead was\Ndangerous it was already too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly their population started\Nto collapse one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandparents mothers fathers\Nchildren the shifting life
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,expectancies caused the\Ngenerations to fall ill around
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The same time they all showed\Nsimilar symptoms, their skin
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and hair turned white as\Ntheir bodies writhed in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No doctor could stop their suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.73,0:09:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,means
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,every single person from\Nhis kingdom died out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So smart, but then the\Nreal misfortune began.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, neighboring\Ncountries watched this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,unfold and with white\Ntowns population dropping
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,like flies they made an\Nassumption that white
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,lead disease was a highly\Ncontagious disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They cut them off in\Nall directions isolating
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,them while ignorantly turning a blind eye
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,with the help from the world government\Ntheir royals all safely fled the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving their citizens behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And when people from Whitetown\Ntried to escape that hellhole,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,be it in search of treatment\Nor their own safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,they were treated like monsters\Nbreaking out of their cages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shot on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more injustice covered\Nup by those in power. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They convinced themselves that\Nit's their problem, not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that's humanity for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But flevins didn't go\Ndown without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They had an abundance of lead\Non hand, including bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, war broke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This gave surrounding countries\Nthe justification to strike back,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and they did so without mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can imagine\Nhow that wrapped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.96,0:10:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,La, you must come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We encountered some\Ncompassionate soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They agreed to let you children escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,La! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.24,0:10:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not while my little sister is dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be there for her. Lammy's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll ask them to save\Nyou a spot on the next ship then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow to come back for you. Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.58,0:11:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll come back for Lammy later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad both died already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They told me to do\Nwhatever I can to live on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm gonna live no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in darkness, there's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Law, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I, when times are at their gloomiest,\Njust know someone's watching over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, we're short-staffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, we're in dire\Nneed of blood donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a way to remove the\Nwhite lead from a contaminated body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not contagious either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't the government address that yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.98,0:12:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My body hurts everywhere, and\Nmy skin keeps getting blotchier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep hanging in there, Lammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Our father is the best\Ndoctor in the whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he'll fix you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so noisy outside\Nright now? Another festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Flevents has always been the kind\Nof town that likes to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, get well soon so we can\Ngo to the next one together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me hide in here until I come get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Located at Purse 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma, please say you'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, even in\Ndarkness, there's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When times are at their gloomiest,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know someone's watching over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm gonna live no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Abby!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that, the beautiful\Nwhite down Flavens was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, greed always comes out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If I went through that at 10, I'd\Nbe screwed up in the head, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't blame the kid for\Nbeing rough around the edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There, that's Corazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair that my parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,my sister, and my friends from the church\Ndied when this idiot is allowed to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do this quietly and go unnoticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody will care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If one scumbag goes missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jim, he saw me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke the blood law and\Nnow you're gonna get impaled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a family of Celestial Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hang them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're former Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy won't care if we kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll just look the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll finally have a chance\Nto retaliate against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd see the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's break their bones with a hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shower them with arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't kill them yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to keep them alive,\Nso they can really suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You took my two cents from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They were innocent children!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They just walked in front of a\Ncelestial dragon, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But they paid the ultimate price!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that even fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter was their slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She barely escaped her captors alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She came home, devastated, and\Nkilled herself three days later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I, too, suffered as a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes, because of you, I am blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never get to see my wife again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you treated us like animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So why should we give a damn, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the heavenly\Ntribute, we must forfeit to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our beautiful nations succumb to famine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever been hungry\Na day in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our people are dying from starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all like gods, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.40,0:17:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's true, you won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can shoot you all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Duffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But you treat us like we're\Nnothing more than insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever known grief?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even once in your life,\Nhave you fell agony?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're gonna show it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Law did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gone mad, Saint Homing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you haven't thought this through!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would a man in your position reject\Nyour divine right to live as a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But we are human, are we not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't include us in that\Nludicrous statement, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That accusation's blasphemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You filthy traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.12,0:18:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've always known you\Nto be a raving heretic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How obscene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave Marie Joie at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is as far as we're\Npermitted to take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.02,0:18:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the northern\Nend of our parameters and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,approaching a region unaffiliated\Nwith the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:19:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your living quarters and belongings\Nhave been prepared for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be more than adequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please hand over your\NCelestial Dragon ID chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is it. We'll live humbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the slaves, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If they ran away, we\Nshould buy some new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolfi, Rosanante, things will be\Ndifferent from now on. I must teach you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need you to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're humans from this day forward
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans? Uh-huh. From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,we shall leave our old\Nlives back in Marajoie
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A simpler life will be\Nmuch more fulfilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,True wealth lies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools, listen, you must kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Respect, someone go fetch me my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:20:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You buffoon shouldn't mess with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the celestial dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hang them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, why are they\Nnot kneeling before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not here. They must have fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't have gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.08,0:20:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it a slow death!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We want them to suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take out centuries\Nof revenge on that family!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is coming after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,On the bright side, at\Nleast the rain let up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and we seem to have lost track\Nof the angry mob chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you expect us to\Nlive in this filthy box?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.14,0:21:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There are bugs everywhere, and this\Nrotten stench is gonna make me hurl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They must still be\Nnearby—find that family!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.84,0:21:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,die
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We should leave, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never have predicted\Nthis would turn out so poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was far too optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, just take us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even just my wife and children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They deserve to return at the very least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear if we stay here any\Nlonger, we'll be slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What has been abandoned\Ncannot be returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose this life for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.02,0:21:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you dare call us again,\Nyou worthless human filth. Kalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:21:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn. Bread thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, for the first time\Nin my life, I feel pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, for the first time\Nin my life, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up quick, Rosie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time I've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, we brought you some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.62,0:22:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie, Rosie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.90,0:22:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.52,0:22:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.96,0:22:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.87,0:22:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.72,0:23:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my boys! But Mercy!\NThe children! Let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.54,0:23:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You did this to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.66,0:23:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master, we have apprehended law.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.16,0:23:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like the boy was\Ntrying to make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimmy, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.54,0:23:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At the port, tried fleeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.68,0:23:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of punishment do you\Nthink they'll use at him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,To know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.71,0:23:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure feel bad for him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.68,0:23:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Corazon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.44,0:23:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.38,0:23:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.08,0:23:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're gonna kill me for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought bribing buffalo with\Nice cream would cover it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.26,0:24:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But that scumbag Cora ratted me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.20,0:24:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I could've sworn I stabbed\Nhim right through his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.60,0:24:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's acting like nothing happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.25,0:24:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I called you to discuss something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.52,0:24:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.92,0:24:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to welcome you to the\NDon Quixote family officially.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.10,0:24:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.52,0:24:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.88,0:24:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking at you, I can tell\Nyou've been through hell and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.74,0:24:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You have that hate-filled\Nglare in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.42,0:24:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll have a\Nlot to offer our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.50,0:24:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that? Lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.34,0:24:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master is a brilliant\Njudge of character.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.22,0:24:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he not know about\Nme stabbing Corazon yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.24,0:24:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.50,0:24:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He could have just written it\Nout on a piece of paper for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.54,0:24:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is he planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.82,0:25:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.08,0:25:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I got three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.30,0:25:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'm gonna die. The end. Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.68,0:25:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.59,0:25:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Depends on your luck. Luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.92,0:25:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.72,0:25:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're what you call experts\Nin the black market,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.22,0:25:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and one of our fields is devil fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.52,0:25:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Their powers are vast, sometimes\Nbeyond human comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.28,0:25:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning there may be a Devil Fruit\Nthat could cure your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil fruits, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.38,0:25:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.42,0:25:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You have three years left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.10,0:25:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how many devil\Nfruits we'll find in that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.06,0:25:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And one of them just might have\Na life-altering solution for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But for the time being,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.66,0:25:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to train you to be my\Nright-hand man ten years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.04,0:25:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stabbed by an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.48,0:25:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You take care of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.18,0:26:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.90,0:26:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now patch that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.14,0:26:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Karoo just cover for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.46,0:26:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on in his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.60,0:26:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll head toward Reverse\NMountain in the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to keep moving our base,\Nexpand our network on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.00,0:26:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.64,0:27:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.46,0:27:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we told our real names. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.52,0:27:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.98,0:27:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.22,0:27:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.72,0:27:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.96,0:27:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be dead soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.96,0:27:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe. You're paler. You feel sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.72,0:27:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine for now, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.58,0:27:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But before too long, I'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.94,0:28:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, it's one more\Nreason to reveal your real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.34,0:28:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say it, or I'll tell\Neveryone that you stabbed Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.36,0:28:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Trafalgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.78,0:28:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dee, Water Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.86,0:28:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.96,0:28:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually not supposed to\Nlet people hear my full name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.88,0:28:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So just stick to law.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.48,0:28:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't use code names like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.36,0:28:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hide some parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.32,0:28:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Dee, that secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.10,0:28:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My true name is Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For generations, my\Nfamily - Okay, we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.64,0:28:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.55,0:28:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.02,0:28:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I only told you because\Nyou were harassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.14,0:28:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.64,0:28:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal, Corazon?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.54,0:28:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.02,0:28:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get beat up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cora looks scarier than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.70,0:28:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem, stupid jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.56,0:29:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What you just said, was it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.62,0:29:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.24,0:29:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your secret name's D.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.32,0:29:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's right, you need\Nto get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.90,0:29:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Away from Dofi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.84,0:29:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Law, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.86,0:29:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot be around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.22,0:29:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to get out of here.
